<header class="head"><span class="label">AQA 7552 / EXAM PRACTICE</span><h1>Past papers<br /><span>for AQA 7552.</span></h1><p>Use official AQA question papers and mark schemes. Select Product Design (7552), then filter by paper and year on AQA’s resource page.</p></header>
<section class="content"><div class="paper"><span>01 / 7552/1</span><h2>Technical principles</h2><p>2 hours 30 minutes · 120 marks · 30% of the A-level.</p><a href="https://www.aqa.org.uk/subjects/design-and-technology/a-level/design-and-technology-7552/assessment-resources" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find Paper 1 resources ↗</a></div><div class="paper"><span>02 / 7552/2</span><h2>Designing and making principles</h2><p>1 hour 30 minutes · 80 marks · 20% of the A-level.</p><a href="https://www.aqa.org.uk/subjects/design-and-technology/a-level/design-and-technology-7552/assessment-resources" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find Paper 2 resources ↗</a></div><p class="source">Question papers, mark schemes and examiner reports are hosted by AQA. This page links to their current assessment resources so that you always see the available years.</p></section>
</Base>
